# Personal, machine-local Claude Code project settings: permission allowlists,
# hook wiring, model/effort preferences, env vars. Never committed - see
# docs/claude-setup.md. The superproject's .gitignore cannot reach in here,
# so this file is what keeps a mounted checkout clean.
settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Work-plan settings: which model critiques a plan and when it runs. These are
# per-user choices, not project facts - the plans themselves (plans/<key>/plan.md)
# are the shared artifact and stay tracked. Recreated by /work-plan's first-run
# prompt in any clone that lacks it.
plans/config.json
